WEBVTT

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:32.950
Everybody, get on.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.780
We need to get out of this red fog.

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.200
Got it.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.460
We beat them somehow.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:47.500
Yes, just barely.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.340
Is everyone here?

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.300
-Rinacchi!
-Ji!

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:53.550
-Yo!
-Mu!

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.800
We're all here.

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:59.510
The red root hasn't noticed us
since we came to Island Ten.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:02.930
But the Red Bugs sure are tough here.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:09.980
I see something.

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:12.990
The roots are coming from there too.

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.360
Let's go.

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:21.410
Inside the dark my heartbeat echoes

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:28.290
Long night will continue on

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:31.880
Time to face the hell that surrounds you
Before you crash and burn

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:35.260
Within the fire
Your soul will rise now

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:54.690
Breathe in, breathe out
Your blank gaze on the brink of life

00:01:54.900 --> 00:02:01.490
Step hard on the accelerator now
Escape the tunnel and overtake that pain

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:08.500
A shadow disappears into smoke

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:16.340
Lost light will continue on tomorrow

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:23.470
Someday our world will change
Inside a fantasy Remember, remember

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:30.560
I will mercilessly break your dream
and steal it away, with these hands

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:36.940
Until this body breaks
Beyond the limit We'll never surrender

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:40.360
Endless agony

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:44.620
Finding my life in the KEMURIKUSA

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.350
There are a lot of tall buildings.

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:08.060
We should travel on top of them
if the red fog comes up again.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:12.230
The mountain on Island Nine
was like this too.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:18.860
The island's bottom
crumbled by the red fog.

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:22.320
Maybe it has something to do
with Kemurikusa.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:24.070
Not Kemurikusa again.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:27.410
Not everything is about Kemurikusa,
you know.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.620
You're right.
I should get a closer look.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.000
Rinaji is so smart.

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.840
How's the water?

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:37.960
Well...

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.720
There isn't any around here.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.720
I was hoping we'd find some
along the way.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:52.730
We only have just enough left
to get us back to Island Seven.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:07.080
Sis, stop.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:16.130
-No more traveling on the tracks.
-Yeah.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:20.210
The red fog is swirling around.
What noise...

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:23.840
Yeah, it's really thick.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:29.890
I think the root goes past it...
Upwards, I think.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:32.430
We're headed the right way.

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:35.480
Sis, let's go up higher.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.230
Okay.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:53.250
What is this place?

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:11.350
Is this the end of the island?

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:15.230
No more land past here?

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:19.230
Then how do we get to the red tree?

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:24.950
Over there. I hear the wind.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:28.620
You're right, I hear something.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:30.780
From the other side of the fog.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:41.090
It's...!

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:49.340
What is it? What do you see?

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:51.470
Up there. There are buildings.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.720
Wait, aren't they floating?

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:56.560
Is the root close?

00:05:56.730 --> 00:06:00.310
It's a little past that. It's pretty warm.

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:02.270
I think the trunk is close.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.280
No doubt about it. It's there.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.580
So we have to climb up there, huh?

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:16.120
It's so far. Rina-chan can't see.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:19.120
Not even Sis Rin could jump that high.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:25.170
Something's hanging down
from that building.

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.170
Oh, you're right.

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:29.590
Let's go.

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:50.570
This is a root too, right?

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.490
It's withered... But what color is it?

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.700
It's neither red nor green.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:03.040
-It's huge.
-It's thick.

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:05.250
We can walk on this.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:06.920
Let's travel on it.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.840
Rin, it's almost night.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:15.310
You're right. Let's rest for today
and climb tomorrow.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:24.810
Kemurikusa again?

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.190
What's he laughing about?

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:30.700
Wakaba-kun really likes that.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.110
The red tree's trunk is close.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:36.490
We may have to fight right away tomorrow.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.620
You guys cover from behind.

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:40.580
-Okay.
-To secure a retreat.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:41.920
Keep Red Bugs away.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:46.800
If we see the trunk, we'll close in
before it notices us, and I'll defeat it.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:52.880
We only have about 8 big leaves
from Midori-chan left.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:57.060
Depending on the size of the trunk,
I may need a few to sever it.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.600
I can't waste any
when we're getting close.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:03.310
I hope we can get there unnoticed.

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:07.150
It seems like it reacts to our main body.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:10.360
Either way, it attacks Kemurikusa.

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:15.030
And Ryoku-san...
Her notes said something too.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:18.120
I may be able to control it
if I touch the trunk.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:23.210
So once we see the red tree,
I'll try to go up and touch it.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:27.000
Really? Aren't you afraid of fighting?

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.340
Well yes, but...

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:35.720
We've finally got a chance at this.
I want to do what I can.

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:42.430
Yeah, I wish there was something
you could do to help us.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.150
But for now, stay out of the red fog.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.980
Okay, let's drink up.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:53.360
-Our last drink of water.
-Yeah...

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:57.200
I've split it all up,
so savor every last drop.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:01.910
Oh...

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.910
Okay, drink it all up now!

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.880
-Wakaba, aren't you drinking?
-Come on.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.420
Oh, yes. Thank you.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.210
-So it's finally time.
-Yeah.

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:19.010
I never imagined we'd be able
to get this far from Island One.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:20.850
This is amazing.

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:25.440
What's wrong?

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:30.900
It's the last of the water,
so I'm drinking slowly.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:32.690
We're enjoying it.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:39.820
It likes imitating Wakaba.

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:41.950
Shiro doesn't need water.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:49.040
This may be our last night
to be able to chat like this.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:51.040
Don't talk like that.

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:57.340
Rin, you're strong, so you can return
to Island Seven after you beat the trunk.

00:09:57.510 --> 00:10:00.720
Stop it. We're all going back together.

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:05.270
If you end up not being able to move,
I'll go to Island Seven to get water.

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.140
I don't need as much water as you all.

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:12.650
And once we beat the red tree,
maybe I won't have to avoid the roots.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:16.820
You're always so positive.
That's just like you.

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:20.200
-Yeah.
-Even though you're the weakest.

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:23.700
But hunches are important.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.700
-Yeah, think after you bite.
-Right.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:31.080
Rina got to eat lots on this trip
thanks to you.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:32.130
Rina is happy.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:35.420
We didn't even know
there was an Island Ten.

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:37.630
Lots of rare delicacies too.

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:42.550
It's okay, Shiro.

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:45.560
Rina-chan is all stuffed now.

00:10:46.350 --> 00:10:48.730
-See?
-All full.

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:52.190
We can make another Rina now.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.730
You're right.

00:10:56.900 --> 00:11:02.780
I didn't think we'd all make it safely
to where we can see the red tree.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:11.790
W-What is it?

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:15.840
-Nothing.
-What? Did I do something?

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.050
Go to sleep.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:33.350
It's not so bad looking at it.

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:37.530
Not so bad hearing it either.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.900
What is it, Rin?

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:44.780
We may not have time
to talk much starting tomorrow.

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.740
So I thought I'd say it now.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:53.750
I know it's late to say this, but thanks
for being the big sis all this time.

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:58.000
You simply woke up before us.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:02.470
But you became our leader.
You really saved us all.

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:03.890
Thank you.

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:07.560
I'm grateful too.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:13.310
If I'd woken up later
and become the younger sister,

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:16.270
I probably couldn't have
pushed myself so much.

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:19.480
I would've died earlier on.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:21.240
I owe it to you all.

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:24.610
Thank you for being a little sis.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:25.820
Oh, come on.

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:30.830
My sisters and Midori-chan
mean the world to me.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:34.750
I'm just so glad I got to travel
with everyone like this.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:40.800
And I'm glad I got to see
you looking so gentle again.

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:42.630
What do you mean?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:47.800
Your expression has loosened up
ever since Wakaba-kun arrived.

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:50.140
It really shows in your face.

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:52.310
Really...?

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:56.230
I don't think Wakaba-kun is poison.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.690
Maybe more like medicine.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:01.690
Don't let your guard down so much.

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:04.360
I still don't trust him.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:11.080
I'm glad you're close to
finding out what you like.

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:14.250
Okay, time to get some sleep.

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:17.380
It's going to be a tough day tomorrow too.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:18.710
Good night.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:22.210
Yeah. Good night to you too, Sis.

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:35.730
Let's go.

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:39.110
Rin, Wakaba-kun, be careful.

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:40.820
Take it easy.

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:43.150
-Or else, you'll miss something.
-Yeah.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:46.450
Huh, what are you two saying?

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:54.200
Sis! Rina!

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:57.460
I can't go any further with you, Rin.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.750
Rina wanted to eat that red tree.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.500
But you can have it.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:05.550
I'm sorry for
leaving it all up to you, Rin.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:10.720
That's nothing.
But I can't leave you two here.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:14.640
-After we came this far?
-Oh jeez.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:17.480
I made these for you.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:24.940
Sis, Rina, you didn't drink the water?

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:27.450
A bit of water couldn't have helped us.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:30.530
It's better for you to use it.

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:34.660
You're overreacting.
We won't die just yet.

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:40.460
If you move the red root for us,
we might make it back to Island Seven.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.630
So go, Rin.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.760
We came this far. Go do it!

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.760
You can do it, Sis Rin.

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:58.980
Let's go, Rin-san.

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:01.350
All right.

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:11.910
Shiro, could you protect Rina-san
and Ritsu-san here?

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:14.830
HELPFUL?

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:17.200
It'd be a huge help.

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:24.630
Hey, um...

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:26.340
Thanks.

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:31.550
That's reassuring. Thank you.

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:35.430
If anything happens,
you can go chase after Wakaba.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.060
I'm going.

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:45.820
Hurry up! Don't make Sis Rin go alone.

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:48.730
-Come on, get going!
-Yeah!

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:49.990
I will!

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:54.200
Hey, don't push me. I'm going to fall!

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:55.530
They didn't notice.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.540
-No.
-Good thing they're stupid.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:04.960
That horde of Red Bugs
will attack once Rin reaches the root.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.670
They're just hidden now.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:10.590
We can't walk much,
so we'll stop them here.

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:12.550
-Yeah!
-We'll stop them.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:15.220
Let's rest till then.

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:17.180
Yeah, rest time.

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:28.400
Rin-san, are you okay?

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:29.650
Yeah.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:34.450
The red root is under us.

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:38.660
It goes up after a bit and gets thicker.

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:41.790
So I think the trunk is above that cloud.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:45.290
Let me know when you need a wall.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:47.840
You're assertive today.

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:52.470
We're on our own today,
so I thought I'd do what I can.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:54.130
Besides...

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:55.130
What?

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:58.760
You seem like you're suffering.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:03.100
Shut up. It's not that bad.

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:05.520
It's not, but...

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:11.900
But I'm a little glad you're here.

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:13.860
Oh, well.

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:15.860
And I can use you as a shield.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:20.990
We've come pretty far.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:34.420
We can see a lot from here.

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:36.630
I wonder how all this was made.

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:46.690
We're close now.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:54.570
This is huge.
I wonder what this structure is.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.320
No idea. Let's climb from there.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:17.380
This is a pretty big tree too.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:30.860
I haven't seen this color before,
but it's a Kemurikusa.

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:36.820
So are these. Do they have anything to do
with the structure down there?

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.130
That's definitely the tree.

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:55.340
You're right.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:02.430
It'll notice us if we go in there.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:03.600
Yes.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:06.970
Let's go.

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:08.310
Um...

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:11.400
Before we go, can I ask you something?

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:12.560
What?

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:16.690
May I see your Memory Leaf?

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:19.900
Huh? Why all of a sudden?

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:25.950
I'm sure it could tell us
more than Daidai-san did.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:30.460
It might tell us how
we can beat the red tree.

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:33.920
You just want to touch Kemurikusa.

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:37.630
Yes, well that too, but...

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:41.930
I want to do everything I can
before we go.

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:46.100
To defeat that tree, and to keep you safe.

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.100
Fine.

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:55.270
Thank you!

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:01.900
So, how do you make it work?

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:05.160
Um, I'm supposed to just, kind of work it?

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:06.780
Kind of work it?

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.750
Good. Now...

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:14.250
Push. Then, push harder.

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:18.300
Once it throbs, choose a circle.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.380
No, is the order wrong?

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:27.510
Are you okay, Rin-san?

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:30.640
-I'm fine, hurry it up!
-Of course.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.480
Like this... No.

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:36.360
Oh I see, like this!

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:43.570
-Are you done yet?
-I'm sorry, almost...

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:15.730
Are you okay? Is something wrong?

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:17.980
I see a view.

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:19.770
Huh? You mean...

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:23.440
I think it's of the First Person.

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:25.400
Keep going.

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:29.280
Oh, I can hardly see anything.

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:49.800
How's that? What do you see?

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:51.470
It's bright.

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.470
But this view...

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.390
Please tell me more!

00:21:56.560 --> 00:21:59.440
Hold on, I don't understand it either.

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:09.070
I see.

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:14.160
That's right. I'm studying.

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:18.000
I have to hurry and become an adult.
